        "description": "<p>This plugin sets a cookie for cpclid based on a passed in query parameter.  This allows for same domain cookie attribution tracking.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested up to 7.0</li>\n<li>Fixed cookie domain not stripping the &#8220;www.&#8221; prefix, which pinned the cookie to the www subdomain instead of working across the whole domain</li>\n<li>Cookie secure flag now reflects the actual connection (is_ssl()) instead of always being forced on</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested to 6.7</li>\n<li>added new cookie support</li>\n<li>adding in icon</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Contributor name change.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Author name change.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Plugin name change.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Modifications based on review.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removal of multi-domain cookie setting.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
